===Etymology===
From {{term|centre}} + {{term|board}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|nautical|lang=en}} The adjustable [[keel]] on a small [[yacht]] or [[dinghy]] that acts, among other things, as [[ballast]] and to counteract the sideways force of the wind.

